  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projet de pr&#xE9;vention et de r&#xE9;ponse multisectorielle d&apos;urgence aux besoins des survivant-e-s de VBG, et protection contre l&#x2019;exploitation et les abus sexuels dans les provinces du Nord-Kivu et de l&#x2019;Ituri</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide protection against gender-based violence to vulnerable people affected by conflict and displacement in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. This UNFPA project provides dignity kits and access to GBV services, including psychosocial support, and raises awareness on GBV among the population and implementing partners. The project provides life-saving humanitarian assistance in the Protection (GBV) sector to 4,420 people, including 2,300 women, 2,000 children, and 640 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
